WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.946
- Congrats on your Emmy,
"White Lotus," my god.

00:00:01.946 --> 00:00:03.013
- [Speaker 1] Yes.
(crowd cheers)

00:00:03.013 --> 00:00:03.846
- Thank you.

00:00:03.846 --> 00:00:04.679
- [Kumail] So well earned.

00:00:04.679 --> 00:00:05.687
- [Murray] Thank you, yeah.

00:00:05.687 --> 00:00:06.810
- [Kumail] Wow. So good.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:11.250
- Yeah, it was a pretty epic
night, that Emmys night,

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.500
because we shot "White Lotus"

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.420
in the, sort of, the
beginning of the pandemic

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.580
and then we didn't really see each other,

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.860
that cast, for a long period of time,

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.900
'cause we were, you know,
thick in the pandemic.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.980
So the Emmys night, when a
lot of the cast was nominated,

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.840
was one of the first times
we were all back together.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.260
So it felt like this
beautiful reunion and then,

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.070
you know, we were blessed to
keep winning awards that night.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.209
So it was just this,
like, sort of ramping up

00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:38.610
of excitement for us.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.187
- Yeah, he won them all.

00:00:40.187 --> 00:00:41.020
(audience whoops)

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:41.853
- It was a bit of a sweep.

00:00:41.853 --> 00:00:43.519
I have to say, yeah.
- (laughs)

00:00:43.519 --> 00:00:44.880
- It was a bit of a sweep. Well deserved.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:45.713
- Thank you.

00:00:45.713 --> 00:00:46.909
- I mean, that show's
fantastic and you were so good.

00:00:46.909 --> 00:00:47.742
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:47.742 --> 00:00:49.230
- Thank you.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.960
- I remember I ran into you at the airport

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.340
the very next day.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.173
- [Murray] Yes.
- [Speaker 1] You did?

00:00:54.173 --> 00:00:55.110
- And you were just
there with your backpack

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:55.943
and I was like...
- Randomly.

00:00:55.943 --> 00:00:56.776
- (laughs)
- Yeah, I was like,

00:00:56.776 --> 00:00:58.260
Where's your Emmy? He's
like, I checked it.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.204
You checked your Emmy?

00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:00.037
(audience laughs)

00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:01.320
- You did? You didn't
have it in your carry-on?

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.160
- No, he didn't!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.247
He just gave it to, like,

00:01:03.247 --> 00:01:04.666
"Put this in the bottom of the plane"

00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:06.265
- (Laughs)

